---
source: crates/cli/tests/help.rs
expression: "help(&[\"query\", \"--help\"])"
---
Print a range as json, csv, or markdown

Usage: omacell query [OPTIONS] <BOOK> <RANGE>

Arguments:
  <BOOK>
          Workbook path

  <RANGE>
          A1 range (`Sheet!A1:D20`)

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>
          Output table format

          Possible values:
          - json: JSON array of rows
          - csv:  CSV
          - md:   GitHub-flavored markdown table
          
          [default: json]

      --json
          Machine-readable stdout (and stderr errors)

      --dry-run
          Validate writes without changing files

      --formulas
          Emit formula-bar text instead of values

      --set <KEY=VALUE>
          Overlay a dotted config key (`appearance.grid_lines=false`). Repeatable

      --config <FILE>
          Explicit config file; replaces `$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/omacell/config.toml`

      --theme <FILE>
          Explicit Omacell role overlay TOML; wins over `OMACELL_THEME`

  -q, --quiet
          Suppress non-error human output

  -v, --verbose...
          Increase log verbosity

      --from-workbook <FILE>
          Workbook whose frozen settings overlay configuration

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
